WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
In this video I'll show you how to create an ApunteQuiz account to save your quizzes and access your personalized dashboard.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
First, click on the "Sign up" button in the top right corner. Or you can go directly to the registration page.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Now complete the form. Enter your full name. Your email address. And create a strong password. The meter will indicate how strong your password is. Make sure it has at least 8 characters, uppercase, lowercase letters, and numbers.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Check the box to accept the terms of use and privacy policy.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:30.000
Finally, click on "Create account". You will receive an email to verify your account. Open the email and click on the verification link.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:45.000
Done! Your account has been created. Now you can log in and start generating your quizzes. Thank you!

